Domain Entity StaffDirectoryInformation
documentation "The contact information associated to a staff member."
    domain entity Staff
        documentation "A reference to the staff member."
        is part of identity
    domain entity EducationOrganization
        documentation "A reference to the education organization representing the context of the staff information"
        is part of identity
    common Address
        documentation "The set of elements that describes an address, including the street address, city, state, and ZIP code."
        is optional collection
    common InternationalAddress
        documentation "The set of elements that describes an international address."
        is optional collection
    common Telephone
        documentation "The 10-digit telephone number, including the area code, for the person."
        is optional collection
    common ElectronicMail
        documentation "The numbers, letters, and symbols used to identify an electronic email (e-mail) user within the network to which the individual or organization belongs."
        is optional collection
